UPDATE companies SET description='Selhorst Woodworks operates from Las Vegas, Nevada, where husband-and-wife team Matthew and Chantel Selhorst founded the company on a shared vision to create exceptional spaces through thoughtful design and expert craftsmanship. The business identifies as family-owned and grew from a passion for woodworking into a custom finish carpentry operation serving the Las Vegas area.

The shop produces custom architectural woodwork including accent walls and ceilings, barn doors, shelving, built-ins, mudrooms, beams, baseboards, and crown molding. It also offers wallpaper installation and design services, and works with specialty materials such as Thermory thermally modified wood and Renson products. The company describes its approach as delivering meticulous attention to detail from consultation through final installation.

Clients include homeowners, interior designers, builders, and architects who value timeless design and craftsmanship. Projects range from residential upgrades to custom millwork for new construction, with the team emphasizing seamless integration of custom features into existing or new spaces.

The founders state that the company was built on an unwavering commitment to quality and the belief that the smallest details make the biggest impact. They position the business around a family-first philosophy, treating each project with the same care they would apply to their own home, and aim to create spaces that are both beautifully designed and built to be enjoyed for years.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Accent wall fabrication and installation", "Accent ceiling fabrication and installation", "Barn door design and construction", "Custom shelving and built-ins", "Mudroom systems", "Beam fabrication and installation", "Baseboard and crown molding installation", "Wallpaper installation", "Design services", "Thermory thermally modified wood processing", "Renson product integration"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "Interior design", "Commercial construction", "Architecture"], "materials": ["Thermory thermally modified wood", "Renson products", "Wood"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Family-owned and operated by founders Matthew and Chantel Selhorst", "Custom finish carpentry from design through installation", "Specialty material expertise including Thermory and Renson products", "Serves homeowners, interior designers, builders, and architects"], "facts_used": ["Location: Las Vegas, Nevada -> db (hq_city, hq_state_label)", "Founders: Matthew and Chantel Selhorst -> / (Our Story section)", "Ownership: Family-owned -> / (Family Owned badge and Our Story)", "Services: Accent walls, ceilings, barn doors, shelving, built-ins, beams, baseboards, crown molding, wallpaper, design services -> / and /services", "Specialty materials: Thermory, Renson -> / and /services", "Industries served: Homeowners, interior designers, builders, architects -> / (Our Story)", "Company philosophy: Commitment to quality, family-first approach, attention to detail -> / (Our Story)"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Selhorst Woodworks was built on a shared vision between husband-and-wife team Matthew and Chantel Selhorst: to create exceptional spaces through thoughtful design, expert craftsmanship, and an unwavering commitment to quality. What began as a passion for woodworking has grown into one of Las Vegas'' premier custom finish carpentry companies... Our team approaches every project with the same care and pride we''d put into our own home. Whether we''re crafting statement ceilings, architectural wall treatments, custom built-ins, fireplace surrounds, or bespoke millwork...", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='selhorst-woodworks-las-vegas-san-diego-accent-walls-and-ceilings-barn-doors-shelving-beams' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Sentinel Solar is based in Covington, Kentucky, and serves customers across Kentucky and Ohio. The company was founded by Jan Thurman, who brought over a decade of coast-to-coast experience in residential and commercial solar to establish a firm built on the conviction that solar should be done right or not at all.

The company designs and installs custom solar-plus-storage systems for homes and businesses, handling every step from permitting and utility approval to final commissioning. Its services include residential solar with battery backup, commercial solar arrays, EV charger installation, and generator integration. All work is performed by Sentinel''s own crews rather than subcontractors, and recent projects include installations at a private residence in Fort Mitchell, Kentucky, and at Wenzel Distillery and ProMaster in Cincinnati, Ohio.

The company emphasizes long-term relationships over volume, positioning itself as a premium provider rather than a high-volume installer.

Thurman founded the business to offer a local, accountable alternative to national franchises. The company cites four guiding principles: a consultative, non-transactional sales approach; local accountability with a team that lives in the community; installer-first quality that prioritizes safe, correct installation; and a referral-driven model that depends on long-term customer satisfaction.', certifications=ARRAY['Kentucky licensed and insured','Ohio licensed and insured']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Full-Service Permitting", "Residential Solar + Storage Design", "Commercial Solar Design", "Battery Storage Installation", "EV Charger Installation", "Generator Installation", "Custom System Design", "Expert Installation", "Utility Approval Management"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial", "Renewable Energy"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Consultative, non-transactional sales approach", "Local accountability with community-based team", "Installer-first quality prioritizing safe, correct installation", "Referral-driven model based on long-term customer satisfaction", "Licensed and insured in Kentucky and Ohio"], "facts_used": ["Founder Jan Thurman -> /about", "Headquarters Covington, Kentucky -> db", "Services: residential and commercial solar + storage, permitting, battery, EV charger, generator -> /", "Licensed & insured in Kentucky and Ohio -> /", "Projects in Fort Mitchell, KY and Cincinnati, OH -> /", "Values: premium not transactional, local accountability, installer-first quality, long-term relationships -> /about", "Company is not a volume shop, premium provider -> /about"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Expert design, professional installation, and lasting energy savings \u2014 from a local team with over a decade of coast-to-coast experience.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='sentinel-solar' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Servall Uniform & Linen Supply was founded in 1938 in Rapid City, South Dakota. From its start serving hometown businesses, the company has grown to operate across a two-state region, with physical locations in Chamberlain, South Dakota, and Gillette, Wyoming (and an office in Cheyenne, Wyoming).

The company provides uniform rental and direct purchase, linen rental, industrial laundry services, restroom and sanitation supplies, janitorial products, first aid kits, dust control mats, towel and bedding programs, hand sanitizer stations, and ice melt. Servall manages scheduled pickup and delivery for its rental programs, serving hundreds of customers throughout western South Dakota and eastern Wyoming from its regional facilities.

Customers include healthcare providers such as Spearfish Canyon Healthcare, hospitality landmarks like Wall Drug, publishing operations such as Ravellette Publications, financial institutions including First Interstate Bank, and independent retailers like Alternative Fuel Coffee House. The company’s service area covers communities from Spearfish, Custer, and Hot Springs in South Dakota to Sheridan, Gillette, and Buffalo in Wyoming.

Servall emphasizes reliable, locally based service and the convenience of consolidated facility supply programs. Its stated mission is to provide dedicated, professional service that delivers cost value and enhanced productivity within weeks, backed by long-tenured delivery representatives who build ongoing relationships with client sites.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Uniform rental", "Uniform direct purchase", "Linen rental", "Industrial laundry services", "Restroom and sanitation supplies", "Janitorial supplies", "First aid supplies", "Dust control mats", "Towel and bedding programs", "Hand sanitizer stations", "Ice melt supply"], "industries": [], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Regional service across South Dakota and Wyoming since 1938", "Physical locations in Rapid City, Chamberlain (SD) and Gillette (WY)", "Integrated uniform rental, linen rental, laundry, and facility supply programs", "Dependable scheduled delivery and pickup service with long-tenured route drivers"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1938 -> db", "Headquarters Rapid City, SD -> db", "Locations in Chamberlain, SD and Gillette, WY -> /", "Services: uniform rental, linen rental, laundry, restroom, janitorial, first aid, dust control, mats, towel/bedding, hand sanitizer, ice melt -> /", "Service area: western SD and eastern WY -> /", "Customer examples: Spearfish Canyon Healthcare, Wall Drug, Ravellette Publications, First Interstate Bank, Alternative Fuel Coffee House -> /", "Mission: dedicated professional service, cost value, enhanced productivity -> /"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Our staff is proud to offer a variety of services from uniform and linen rentals to comprehensive janitorial and first aid supply programs.", "founded_year": "1938", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "s