UPDATE companies SET description='Simplex Fabrication operates from Woodbine, Maryland, where owner Seth Neilson began the business roughly a decade ago. Neilson purchased an inexpensive TIG welder online and taught himself to weld on a personal vehicle in his garage, turning a hobby into a full-time fabrication shop.

The shop provides welding, metal fabrication, and CNC plasma cutting services. Work ranges from rust repair on automotive and equipment components to one-off custom builds such as a go-kart belt sander and a climbing saddle hunting tree stand. Neilson handles all production himself, offering quotes via call, text, or email.

Customers include individual hobbyists, equipment owners needing repairs, and anyone with a concept requiring metal fabrication. Projects have spanned automotive restoration, recreational vehicle modifications, and custom outdoor gear, though the company does not list specific industry verticals.

Neilson emphasizes continuous improvement, stating he enjoys "innovating better ways of doing things." The business grew from personal passion rather than a formal business plan, with a focus on bringing customer ideas to life regardless of scale.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["TIG welding", "CNC plasma cutting", "Metal fabrication", "Rust repair", "Custom fabrication"], "industries": [], "materials": [], "equipment": ["TIG welder", "CNC plasma cutter"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Owner-operated with hands-on involvement in every project", "Custom fabrication from concept to finished part", "Repair and restoration of metal components", "CNC plasma cutting combined with manual welding", "Self-taught expertise driving innovative solutions"], "facts_used": ["Owner: Seth Neilson -> /", "Location: Woodbine, Maryland -> db", "Started 10 years ago as hobby with cheap TIG welder -> /", "Services: welding, fabrication, CNC plasma cutting -> /", "Projects: rust repair, go-kart belt sander, climbing saddle hunting tree stand -> /", "Contact via call, text, email for quotes -> /", "Self-taught welder -> /"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "I love welding and fabricating as well as innovating better ways of doing things. If you have an idea you would like to see brought to life, or you just need some cracks rewelded on your lawnmower, I am your guy.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='simplex-fabrication-welding-and-cnc-plasma-cutting' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='The company was built on principles of integrity, creativity, and sustainability, aiming to deliver high-quality, healthy foods via advanced technologies.

The firm develops and manufactures advanced food processing equipment, including thermal processing systems and pumps, while providing R&D and engineering services. It operates a precision-scale aseptic copacking facility (FirstWave Co-Packing) for rapid prototyping and product launches, and offers protein-polyphenol ingredient technology (Vitero) with supporting product development and piloting services. The pilot facility enables small-scale manufacturing to commercialize products without traditional roadblocks.

SinnovaTek serves the food industry, working with both established companies and startups seeking to bring innovative food products to market. Its end-to-end solutions span equipment integration, ingredient technology, and co-manufacturing, targeting forward-thinking food businesses of all sizes.

