UPDATE companies SET description='Siri Wire Co. has operated from Danielson, Connecticut since its founding in 1992. The company is a fourth‑generation family business with more than 50 years of industry experience, and it remains led by the family that built it from the ground up.

The company manufactures and stocks stainless steel and alloy wire, serving customers across North America. Its product range includes electro‑polish quality (EPQ) wire — held in one of the largest domestic stocking positions in the region — as well as cold‑heading and spring wire grades such as 302, 304, 316, 17‑7, 302HQ, 303, 316L, 410, 416, 420, and 430. Siri Wire also provides annealing via strand annealing furnaces, coating and redraw services for customer‑supplied material, and straight‑and‑cut processing. Through its affiliation with Tri Star Metals and the Bender Wire Group, the company now operates behind two fully operational American production mills, enabling domestic melt, DFARS‑compliant, and non‑DFARS material options.

Siri Wire serves medical and surgical device manufacturers, aerospace and defense contractors, automotive suppliers, fastener and cold‑heading producers, filter screen and washer makers, and general industrial customers. Common applications include springs, fasteners, medical equipment, filter screens, washers, and rings.

The company emphasizes its ISO 9001 certification, American‑made production, and a team that stands behind every order. Differentiators cited by the company include same‑day and short lead‑time shipping on stocked EPQ wire, the backing of two domestic mills for broader product range and engineering support, and a family‑owned culture focused on integrity and competitive pricing.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Electro Polish Quality (EPQ) wire production", "Stainless steel and alloy wire manufacturing", "Cold heading wire", "Spring wire", "Annealing (strand annealing furnaces)", "Coating services", "Redraw services", "Straight and cut processing", "Domestic melt, DFARS, and non-DFARS material sourcing", "ASTM A313, AMS 5688, AMS 5678 specification compliance"], "industries": ["Medical and Surgical Devices", "Filter Screens and Washers", "Automotive", "Aerospace and Defense", "Fasteners and Cold Heading", "General Industrial"], "materials": ["302HQ", "303", "316L", "410", "416", "420", "430", "302", "304", "316", "17-7", "Stainless steel", "Alloy wire"], "equipment": ["Strand annealing furnaces"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Same-day and short lead-time shipping for stocked EPQ wire", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Same-day and short lead-time shipping on stocked EPQ wire", "Largest domestic stocking position for EPQ wire in the region", "Two fully operational American production mills via Tri Star Metals and Bender Wire Group", "Domestic melt, DFARS, and non-DFARS material availability", "Family-owned, fourth-generation business with over 50 years industry experience"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1992 -> db", "Headquarters Danielson, Connecticut -> db", "ISO 9001 certified -> db", "Family-owned, fourth-generation business with over 50 years industry experience -> /", "Manufactures and stocks stainless steel wire -> /", "EPQ wire largest domestic stocking position in region -> /", "Same-day and short lead-time shipping on EPQ wire -> /", "Grades: 302HQ, 303, 316L, 410, 416, 420, 430, 302, 304, 316, 17-7 -> /", "Cold heading and spring wire -> /", "Specifications: ASTM A313, AMS 5688, AMS 5678 -> /", "Services: annealing, coating, redraw, straight and cut -> /", "Strand annealing furnaces -> /", "Markets: Medical and Surgical Devices, Filter Screens and Washers, Automotive, Aerospace and Defense, Fasteners and Cold Heading, General Industrial -> /", "Part of Tri Star Metals and Bender Wire Group, two domestic production mills -> /", "Domestic melt, DFARS, non-DFARS material -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Since 1992, Siri Wire has been manufacturing and stocking stainless steel wire for customers across North America", "founded_year": "1992", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='siri-wire-co' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Six B Apparel operates from Henderson, Nevada, producing custom dye-sublimated crew apparel for the racing industry. The company does not disclose its founding year, ownership structure, or the names of its founders in its public materials.

The shop specializes in all-over dye sublimation on lightweight, breathable polyester, delivering full-color, high-resolution prints that cover garments from neck to waist and sleeve to sleeve. Its process uses specially formulated dyes and a heat-transfer application that permanently bonds the image to the fabric, preventing peeling or fading through repeated washing. Products include custom crew shirts and hoodies, with an in-house art department handling design work for every order.

The primary customer base is race teams, from small grassroots outfits to larger operations, all seeking a professional, unified look. The company emphasizes that its no-minimum policy allows teams of any size to access the same quality of custom gear.

