UPDATE companies SET description='Snap Gourmet Foods, Inc. was founded in 2020 in Cleveland, Ohio, by majority partners Jason Chamoun, Allan Lam, and Lincoln Yee. The trio launched the company during the pandemic with the goal of creating an oasis in a local food desert.

