UPDATE companies SET description='Solar Scapes operates from Grain Valley, Missouri, serving the greater Kansas City metropolitan area. The company was founded on the principle that solar customers deserve ongoing support long after installation, a response to an industry where providers often disappear after the sale. Owner and field operator Cory B. leads a small team that includes field operations lead Grant H. and field technician Eric R.

The firm provides a full range of solar energy services: new system design and installation, troubleshooting and repair of existing arrays (including orphaned systems from defunct installers), annual maintenance through its Solar Shield membership program, animal-guard and skirting installation, solar removal and reinstallation for roof replacements, battery storage installation (certified for FranklinWH and Enphase), standby generator installation (certified Generac), and EV charger installation. The team of three performs electrical inspections, thermal imaging, drone-based aerial inspections, and active monitoring with production verification.

Solar Scapes serves residential and commercial customers across the Kansas City metro on both the Kansas and Missouri sides, including Overland Park, Olathe, Lenexa, Shawnee, Leawood, Lee’s Summit, Independence, Blue Springs, and Liberty. Its customer base includes homeowners with underperforming or damaged systems, businesses seeking backup power, and property owners needing roof-related solar removal and reinstallation.

The company differentiates itself by committing to long-term relationships rather than one-time sales, emphasizing honest diagnostics, repair-only-what’s-needed, and standing behind work for the life of the system. Its Solar Shield membership offers tiered preventative maintenance, priority scheduling, and discounts on repairs, aiming to catch issues early and maximize production over the system’s 25-year design life.', certifications=ARRAY['NABCEP Certified']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Solar system design and installation", "Solar service and troubleshooting", "Solar maintenance (Solar Shield program)", "Animal guard and solar skirting installation", "Solar removal and reinstallation", "Battery backup installation (FranklinWH, Enphase)", "Standby generator installation (Generac)", "EV charger installation", "Electrical inspection and testing", "Infrared thermal imaging inspection", "Drone aerial inspection", "Active monitoring and production verification", "Annual production reporting"], "industries": ["Residential solar", "Commercial solar", "Electrical contracting", "Backup power systems", "Electric vehicle charging infrastructure"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["FranklinWH battery systems", "Enphase battery systems", "Generac standby generators", "Thermal imaging cameras", "Drone inspection equipment"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["NABCEP Certified technicians service all brands and orphaned systems", "Solar Shield membership with three tiers of preventative maintenance, monitoring, and repair discounts", "Certified installer for FranklinWH and Enphase battery storage and Generac standby generators", "Local team serving both Kansas and Missouri sides of the Kansas City metro", "Offers solar removal and reinstallation to manufacturer specs for roof replacements"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Grain Valley, Missouri -> db", "Founded on core conviction of long-term solar support -> /about", "Team members: Cory B. (Owne