UPDATE companies SET description='Sonrise Apparel Services operates from Dallas, Texas, where founder Nicole Beavers launched the company in 2005. A WBE‑certified woman‑owned business, it began after Beavers experienced repeated communication failures and missed deadlines while managing production for other brands. Drawing on a fashion design degree from Texas Tech University and years as a sample‑room coordinator and VP for a high‑end western wear line, she built a contract cutting and sewing operation focused on honesty and reliable scheduling.

The shop provides vertical contract manufacturing for soft goods, covering product development, pattern plotting, marker making, bulk and die cutting (hydraulic die press), hot‑strip cutting, sewing, assembly, packaging, warehousing, pick‑and‑pack, and shipping. It handles medium‑to‑large volume runs with typical turnaround of four to six weeks, and can ramp quickly for growth‑stage clients. The team includes production manager Rosalva “Rosie” Almaraz, who has been with the company since 2008.

Sonrise serves established apparel and soft‑goods brands that need consistent, high‑volume production, as well as start‑ups requiring initial runs. Past clients include Crazy Pants, CC Dancewear, and Good Air Team, reflecting a focus on fashion, dancewear, and lifestyle apparel markets.

Beavers started the company to escape the industry’s “careless ways” — mismanaged production, poor communication, and unmet deadlines. The firm emphasizes open, fair, team‑focused service and holds WBE certification, a CAGE code (8RA44), and SAM.gov registration for government work.', certifications=ARRAY['WBE Certified Women Owned Business','CAGE 8RA44','SAM.gov registered']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Sewing", "Bulk Cutting", "Die Cutting (Hydraulic Die Press)", "Hot Strip Cutting", "Warehousing/Storage", "Pick and Pack", "Marker and Pattern Plotting", "Packaging and Shipping", "Assembly", "Product Development"], "industries": ["Apparel", "Soft goods manufacturing", "Fashion"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Hydraulic Die Press"], "volume": "Medium to large volume production; also medium volume for smaller companies", "lead_time": "4-6 weeks", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["4-6 week turn times", "Medium to large contract capabilities", "WBE Certified Women Owned Business", "CAGE code 8RA44 and SAM.gov registered", "Quick ramp\u2011up and versatile production"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2005 in Dallas, Texas -> /about", "WBE Certified Women Owned Business -> /about", "Founder Nicole Beavers, fashion design degree from Texas Tech -> /", "Services: sewing, bulk cutting, die cutting (hydraulic die press), hot strip cutting, warehousing, pick and pack, marker/pattern plotting, packaging/shipping, assembly, product development -> /services", "Turnaround 4-6 weeks, medium to large contract capabilities -> /", "Clients: Crazy Pants, CC Dancewear, Good Air Team -> /", "CAGE code 8RA44, SAM.gov registered, D-U-N-S 112147858 -> /about", "Production manager Rosalva Almaraz since 2008 -> /about"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Sonrise Apparel Services is a vertical contract cutting and sewing company.", "founded_year": "2005", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "8RA44", "min_order": "", "export_complian