UPDATE companies SET description='Southern Maple Co operates from Nashville, Tennessee, where it was founded in 2009. The company began when owner Randy Cuba relocated to Nashville in 2015 and joined the Fort Houston maker space, building on woodworking skills passed down from his father. After refining his craft there, Cuba launched Southern Maple Co as a dedicated custom woodworking shop.

The shop produces custom furniture and cabinetry for both residential and commercial clients. The workforce includes Cuba and craftsman Mark Shreve, who brings eight years of furniture-making experience; the operation runs from a Nashville workshop without a disclosed facility size or headcount.

