UPDATE companies SET description='Southern Medical Corporation was founded in 1987 in Baton Rouge, Louisiana, in response to a shortage of trained technologists capable of performing competent cardiovascular services. The company began as a provider of specialized cardiovascular technologists and has since expanded its scope.

