UPDATE companies SET description='Southern Metal Fabricators operates from Albertville, Alabama, where it was founded in 1991 by Charles Bailey as a two-man shop serving local maintenance and light fabrication needs.

Its 130,000-square-foot high-bay facility sits on six acres of laydown yard and is served by overhead cranes up to 35 tons. In-house capabilities span design (AutoCAD, MTC Shape Cutting, Pro Nest), cutting, forming, welding (AWS D1.1, D1.2, D1.6 certified), finishing (hot-dip galvanizing, priming, painting), assembly, and detailing, with a dedicated quality inspector overseeing every project.

Customers come from agriculture, architecture, automotive, cement, construction, coal and biomass, egg and poultry, feed and grain, iron and steel, mining and quarry, marine, petroleum, paper, plastics, power generation, retail, utilities, and woodworking. The company builds to spec for both industrial and commercial projects, from small transfer carts to large bulk hoppers.

Southern Metal Fabricators differentiates itself by keeping all fabrication under one roof, a philosophy summed up as "Tool up to handle any custom metal fabrication job, start to finish, right here on the premises." It pre-assembles and test-runs products before shipping, assigns a dedicated point of contact for each project, and maintains welding procedures conforming to ASME Section IX and API-650 standards, as well as Canadian Welding Bureau registration.', certifications=ARRAY['ASME','ASME Section IX','API-650','AWS D1.1','AWS D1.2','AWS D1.6','Canadian Welding Bureau W47.1','Canadian Welding Bureau W59 CSA']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Structural steel fabrication", "Silo fabrication", "Industrial ductwork fabrication", "Custom welding (AWS D1.1, D1.2, D1.6)", "In-house detailing (AutoCAD, MTC Shape Cutting, Pro Nest)", "Cutting", "Forming (bending, shaping, punching)", "Finishing (hot-dip galvanizing, priming, painting)", "Assembly (welding, fasteners)", "Pre-assembly and test-run before shipping", "Material handling equipment fabrication", "Conveyor bridge truss fabrication", "Steel ladle fabrication", "Industrial platform, ladder, and stair fabrication", "Bulk storage tank, hopper, and bin fabrication", "Pollution control and dust collector system fabrication", "Design and engineering services", "In-house quality inspection"], "industries": ["Agriculture", "Architecture", "Automotive", "Cement", "Construction", "Coal & Biomass", "Egg & Poultry", "Feed & Grain", "Iron & Steel", "Mining & Quarry", "Marine", "Petroleum", "Paper", "Plastics", "Power Generation", "Retail", "Utilities", "Woodworking"], "materials": ["Carbon steel", "Stainless steel", "Aluminum", "Galvanized steel", "Copper"], "equipment": ["2-ton overhead crane", "3-ton overhead crane", "10-ton overhead crane", "35-ton gantry crane", "MTC Shape Cutting system", "Pro Nest nesting software", "AutoCAD"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": [], "facts_used": ["Founde