UPDATE companies SET description='Southpaw Furniture Co operates from Sturtevant, Wisconsin, where a family-owned workshop has grown from a garage startup into a 5,500-square-foot manufacturing facility with a dedicated 400-square-foot spray booth. The company does not disclose a founding year, but its origins trace back to a passion for solid hardwood craftsmanship that now employs multiple full-time woodworkers.

Each piece moves through hand-cut joinery, sanding, and spray finishing in-house, allowing the team to control color matching and surface quality. The facility’s capacity supports both one-off commissions and repeat orders for residential and commercial clients.

Homeowners make up the core customer base, though the company also furnishes businesses seeking durable, made-to-measure pieces. Reviews highlight projects ranging from oval dining tables with custom stain samples shipped for in-home approval to white-oak kitchen islands with tailored drawer inserts and pull-out mechanisms.

Southpaw’s stated mission centers on sustainability, quality, and personalization—creating furniture intended to last generations rather than seasons. The founders emphasize integrity in client relationships and a commitment to using only solid hardwoods, avoiding veneers or particle board. That philosophy, they say, distinguishes their work from mass-produced alternatives and drives repeat business from clients who value heirloom-grade construction.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Handcrafted furniture making", "Solid hardwood milling and joinery", "Custom furniture design", "Spray finishing", "Stain color matching and sampling", "Custom cabinetry and built-ins", "Nationwide delivery"], "industries": ["Residential furniture", "Commercial furniture", "Custom woodworking", "Interior design"], "materials": ["Solid hardwoods (prime grade)", "Walnut", "White oak"], "equipment": ["400 sq ft spray booth"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Handcrafted in a 5,500 sq ft Wisconsin facility with a dedicated spray booth", "Family-owned, using only prime grade solid hardwoods", "Physical stain samples shipped to customers for in-home selection", "Custom drawer inserts and pull-outs designed collaboratively", "Furniture built to last generations, not seasons"], "facts_used": ["Family-owned furniture shop based in Sturtevant, Wisconsin -> /", "5,000 sq ft workshop -> db", "5,500 sq ft manufacturing facility with 400 sq ft spray booth -> /about", "Multiple full-time employees -> /about", "Garage startup grew into full-time operation -> /about", "Mission: crafting timeless furniture combining sustainability, quality, personalization -> /about", "Vision: premier provider of handcrafted hardwood furniture -> /about", "Core values: Quality, Integrity, Sustainability -> /about", "Uses prime grade hardwoods (walnut, white oak) -> / and /about", "Ships physical stain samples on real wood -> / (reviews)", "Custom drawer inserts and pull-outs -> / (review)", "Nationwide delivery -> db", "Handcrafted solid hardwood furniture -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Solid hardwood furniture expertly handcrafted in our 5,000 sq ft workshop", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "multiple full-time employees", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='southpaw-furniture-co' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Sovereign Plastics operates from a 23,000-square-foot facility in Colorado Springs, Colorado. The company was acquired in June 2022 by The Landers Companies, LLC, a Tucson, Arizona-based holding company; no founding year or original founders are disclosed.

The shop specializes in custom injection molding and in-house mold making, producing over 100 molds annually. Its facility separates machining from molding operations and includes capacity for light assembly, fulfillment, and packaging. The company emphasizes short-run molding flexibility alongside high-production-rate capability.

Sovereign serves automotive, medical, consumer, and industrial markets worldwide.

