UPDATE companies SET description='Specialized Switchgear Solutions LLC is based in Mansfield, Ohio. Knox, a Six Sigma Blackbelt, had overseen manufacturing operations with up to 400 employees, while Smith led special projects and parts management. Their combined experience spans the full lifecycle of medium‑voltage switchgear.

