UPDATE companies SET description='St. Louis Spring Company operates from St. Louis, Missouri, where it has handcrafted leaf springs for more than a century.

The company produces custom leaf spring suspensions for virtually any vehicle type, alongside a stock inventory of leaf springs, u-bolts, bushings, inserts, clips, and center bolts. Each spring is hand-assembled using heavy-duty, high-grade steel sourced from domestic mills.

Customers span a wide spectrum of mobility needs: classic cars, muscle cars, and hot rods; pickup trucks, Jeeps, SUVs, and vans; trailers, heavy-duty fire and dump trucks, commercial and semi trucks, tow trucks, and agricultural equipment. The company also serves niche applications such as demolition derby cars, monster trucks, golf carts, tractors, brush hogs, mobile homes, and RVs.

The firm emphasizes durability through U.S.-made steel, the ability to custom-fabricate any spring specification—including arch height changes, thicker material, or additional leaves—and a turnaround that typically falls within a week. Christian’s five-decade tenure is cited as a guarantee of process knowledge and consistent quality.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom leaf spring manufacturing", "Leaf spring suspension fabrication", "U-bolt manufacturing", "Stock leaf spring supply", "Assembly component supply (bushings, inserts, clips, center bolts)", "Spring arch modification (lift/lower)", "Heavy-duty steel fabrication", "Handcrafted spring assembly"], "industries": ["Classic cars", "Muscle cars", "Hot rods", "Pickup trucks", "Jeeps", "SUVs", "Trailers", "Heavy vehicles (fire trucks, dump trucks)", "Commercial trucks", "Semi trucks", "Tow trucks", "Agricultural equipment", "Demolition derby", "Utility vehicles", "Tractors", "Golf carts", "Monster trucks", "Vans/Sprinter vans", "Brush hogs", "Mobile homes", "RVs/Campers"], "materials": ["Heavy-duty high-quality steel (U.S.-produced)", "Steel"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Most orders within a week, often a few days", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Handcrafted leaf springs made from U.S.-produced heavy-duty steel", "Custom fabrication for any leaf spring specification", "Arch modification (lift or lower), heavier steel, and additional leaves on request", "Most orders shipped within a week"], "facts_used": ["Located in St. Louis, Missouri -> db", "Second-generation family-owned shop -> /", "Over 100 years in operation -> /", "One of the oldest continuously operating leaf spring manufacturers in the country -> /", "Makes custom leaf spring suspension for almost any vehicle -> /", "Carries stock leaf springs, u-bolts, bushings, inserts, clips, center bolts -> /", "Uses heavy-duty, high-quality steel produced in the United States -> /", "Jim Christian, operations mana