UPDATE companies SET description='State Medical Equipment operates from Las Vegas, Nevada, serving the Las Vegas Valley including Henderson, Summerlin, and surrounding areas. The company is family-owned and locally owned, founded as a durable medical supply business with nearly a decade of experience serving patients and healthcare facilities across Southern Nevada.

The company sells and rents a broad range of durable medical equipment and home medical supplies. Its product categories include mobility equipment such as wheelchairs, transport chairs, scooters, power wheelchairs, walkers, rollators, canes, and crutches; rehabilitation and therapy equipment; oxygen and respiratory devices including concentrators and nebulizers; hospital beds, patient lifts, and recovery equipment; power lift chairs; and bathroom and home safety items like shower chairs, commodes, grab bars, and raised toilet seats. In addition to sales and short- or long-term rentals, State Medical Equipment provides professional service and repair, in-home delivery with installation and setup, and a dedicated after-hours team for emergency support. A retail store and showroom allow customers to view and purchase equipment in person.

The customer base spans individual patients, caregivers, healthcare facilities, and visitors to Las Vegas. Examples from customer feedback include travelers needing CPAP replacement parts, families renting wheelchairs or lift chairs for elderly relatives, and patients requiring hospital beds for home recovery. The company coordinates with healthcare providers and serves both local residents and out-of-town visitors.

State Medical Equipment emphasizes its highly trained staff, in-home delivery and setup service, physical retail showroom, and after-hours availability as key differentiators. The business was started to provide a local, accessible source for quality medical supplies and responsive customer service in the Las Vegas area.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Medical equipment sales", "Medical equipment rentals (short- and long-term)", "In-home delivery and setup", "Equipment service and repair", "After-hours emergency support"], "industries": ["Durable medical equipment", "Home healthcare", "Respiratory care", "Mobility assistance", "Rehabilitation equipment"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Highly trained staff available in-store and by phone", "In-home delivery, installation, and setup", "Local retail store and showroom", "After-hours team for emergency support", "Professional medical equipment service and repair"], "facts_used": ["Family-owned, locally owned durable medical supply company -> db", "Nearly a decade of experience serving Las Vegas Valley -> db", "Location: Las Vegas, Nevada; serves Las Vegas, Henderson, Summerlin, Southern Nevada -> /", "Sales and rentals of mobility, rehab, respiratory, hospital beds, lift chairs, bathroom safety equipment -> /", "Service & repair, in-home delivery & setup, after-hours team -> /", "Retail store and showroom -> /", "Customer examples: travelers needing CPAP parts, wheelchair/lift chair rentals, hospital bed rentals -> /", "Differentiators: highly trained staff, in-home delivery/setup, retail showroom, after-hours support -> /"], "company_type": "Retailer", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Come in and visit our local retail store and showroom location to purchase and view all your medical equipment needs", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [