UPDATE companies SET description='Steel Tectonics Inc., doing business as STI Machining, was founded in 2006 in West Jordan, Utah, when Shawn Nelson purchased a small machine shop that had been operating out of a garage. The company remains family-run; Nelson’s two sons, Cody and Justin, are now learning the operation alongside their father, who brings more than 25 years of machining experience.

The shop specializes in high-performance plastics machining and engineering services, offering 2- to 4-axis milling and turning as well as design-for-manufacture support. Production takes place in an 8,000-square-foot facility that houses roughly half a dozen machines. The team works with a range of fluoropolymers and engineering plastics, including PFA, polypropylene, PTFE, acetal, and PVDF.

Nelson says the firm’s edge comes from deep specialization in plastics: every employee is versed in the material’s machining challenges, and the shop has refined speed-and-feed rates to achieve consistent finishes. The operation emphasizes tight lead times and responsive communication as core service differentiators.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["High Performance Plastics Machining", "2-4 Axis Machining", "Design for Manufacture", "Engineering Services"], "industries": ["Semiconductor"], "materials": ["PFA", "Polypropylene", "PTFE", "Acetal", "PVDF"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Deep specialization in plastics machining; all staff trained on material-specific challenges", "Refined speed-and-feed rates for consistent surface finishes", "Design-for-manufacture collaboration to optimize cost and producibility", "Commitment to tight lead times and responsive communication"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2006 -> db", "Shawn Nelson purchased a small machine shop operating out of a garage -> /about", "Family-run business with sons Cody and Justin -> /about", "Operating out of an 8000 sq ft building housing half a dozen machines -> /about", "Primary end-user is the semiconductor industry -> /", "Materials: PFA, Polypropylene, PTFE, Acetal, PVDF -> /", "2-4 Axis Machining Capabilities -> /services", "Design for Manufacture service -> /services", "Expertise in plastic machining; all employees well-versed in challenges -> /", "Thrive with tight lead times and exceptional customer service -> /about"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "We specialize in machining plastics.", "founded_year": "2006", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='steel-tectonics-inc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL