UPDATE companies SET description='The company fabricates custom wrought iron railings, gates, staircases, balconies, metal signage, and decorative art pieces. Its shop performs welding in carbon steel, stainless steel, and aluminum, and handles repair work alongside new builds. Projects move from design through installation, serving both one-off residential jobs and larger commercial contracts.

Customers include homeowners and businesses across the Alamance County region — Elon, Graham, Mebane, Whitsett, Burlington, Glen Raven, Gibsonville, Glenco, Ossipee, Attamahaw, Bellemont, Haw River, and Greensboro. Commercial clients order branded metal signage, while residential clients commission ornamental railings, gates, and staircase systems.

