Sprouted Spelt Crusts are made with the highest quality ingredients and are packed with nutrients. Our Happie Cheese Pizzas are made on our Happie Organic Sprouted Spelt Crusts, with Non-GMO hand shredded mozzarella cheese, and our Non-GMO house-made pizza sauce.", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='stone-sisters-organics' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
